cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these data, please cite them using the metadata from this file, together with the edition shown in the
  table's header. The DOI below is the Zenodo concept DOI, which covers all versions and resolves to the latest one;
  each release also has its own version DOI on Zenodo.
title: "HACS census of Hecke algebras and modules in the cohomology of SL_2(Z)"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Januszewski
    given-names: Fabian
    email: fabian.januszewski@math.uni-paderborn.de
    affiliation: "Universität Paderborn"
abstract: >-
  Census data computed with HACS (Harder Arithmetic Cohomology System): the congruence census, the integral census and
  the integral Hecke structure data set HeckeZ (editions 1, 2 and 3) for the cohomology of SL_2(Z) and of Gamma_0(N) with
  coefficients in the symmetric powers of the standard representation. The data sets are versioned by edition (EDITIONS.md); the edition
  shown in each table's header is the one to cite.
license: CC-BY-4.0
