    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24118877
    description: "Concept DOI of the HACS census data: all versions (resolves to the latest version)."
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24118878
    description: "Version DOI of the HACS census data 0.1.0."
